---
description: Rules for spec-driven artifacts in .specs (phase runner, ADR 029)
globs: .specs/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Follow `.claude/skills/d2rmm-phase-runner/SKILL.md`.
- Never write an `**Approved**:` line the maintainer did not give. Features need no approval line; the phase brief's
  approval covers them.
- Every `spec.md` ships an `acceptance.feature` with a scenario per requirement ID (ADR 023).
- Decisions the maintainer should confirm go to the phase `decisions.md → To confirm`; the rest go in the PR description.
- Run `pnpm specs:check` after edits.
